<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Mute</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Neighbourhood</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">(((((ultraSOUND)))))</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1a4ULG8w3mRUC5hwn9Zhqi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.588" end="00:21.450">Make it sharp because I'm numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.450" end="00:27.323">Like a fire in the sun, I'm burnin' up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.323" end="00:31.339">Want a diamond in the rough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.339" end="00:36.157">And you're not, uh-uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.157" end="00:38.201" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.201" end="00:41.142">Sorry I'm acting weird</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.142" end="00:44.081">Wish I could disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.081" end="00:49.983">Trying to face my fears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.983" end="00:52.908">You can be so sincere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.908" end="00:55.758">Wish I could close my ears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.758" end="00:58.135">Tell me the coast is clear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.135" end="01:00.990" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.990" end="01:03.060">I don't hear a word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.060" end="01:06.795">It's getting kinda loud in my head right now, right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.795" end="01:08.884">I don't hear a word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.884" end="01:12.668">It's getting kinda loud in my head right now, right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.668" end="01:15.568">I see your mouth moving around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.568" end="01:18.522">But I can't hear what's coming out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.522" end="01:24.382">I don't hear a word you say, I turned you down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.382" end="01:27.289" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.289" end="01:33.104">Uh-huh, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.104" end="01:34.929">Uh-huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.929" end="01:37.550" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.550" end="01:43.338">Always making my head ache</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.338" end="01:49.203">Maybe it's the price I pay for trying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.203" end="01:53.310">Now I'm know I'm being fake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.310" end="01:58.503">When we talk, I'm lying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.503" end="02:00.003" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.507" end="02:01.580">I don't hear a word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.580" end="02:05.337">It's getting kinda loud in my head right now, right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.337" end="02:07.414">I don't hear a word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.414" end="02:11.165">It's getting kinda loud in my head right now, right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.165" end="02:14.131">I see your mouth moving around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.131" end="02:17.059">But I can't hear what's coming out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.059" end="02:22.914">I don't hear a word you say, I turned you down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.914" end="02:24.414" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.382" end="02:25.882">Ultrasound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.260" end="02:28.755" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.755" end="02:30.830">I don't hear a word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.830" end="02:34.614">It's getting kinda loud in my head right now, right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.614" end="02:36.744">I don't hear a word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.744" end="02:40.433">It's getting kinda loud in my head right now, right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.433" end="02:43.361">I see your mouth moving around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.361" end="02:46.280">But I can't hear what's coming out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.280" end="02:52.145">I don't hear a word you say, I turned you down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.145" end="02:53.645" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.195" end="02:58.016">I don't hear a word you say, I turned you down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.016" end="03:02.016">I don't hear a word you say, I turned you down</p></div></body></tt>